    i0 Ω φ x x' δ hΩc hx hx' hδφ hδ hpt dΩ hxW hd g hg δL hδL
  obtain ⟨b, rfl⟩ := GlobalTheory.T.tangentBasis_uniformisedGroup_of_raynaudExtension E H R t P Y n vH v' hv'
